    "title": "Measurement of the $\\tau$ Lepton Polarization and $R(D^{*})$ in the Decay $\\bar{B} \\to D^{*} \\tau^{-} \\bar{\\nu}_{\\tau}$",
    "arxiv": "[hep-ex/1612.00529v2](https://arxiv.org/pdf/1612.00529)",
    "time": "2016.12.02",
    "abstract": "We report the first measurement of the $\\tau$ lepton polarization $P_{\\tau}(D^{*})$ in the decay $\\bar{B} \\to D^{*} \\tau^{-} \\bar{\\nu}_{\\tau}$ as well as a new measurement of $R(D^{*})$ using the full Belle data sample of $772 \\times 10^{6}$ $B\\bar{B}$ pairs. We obtain $R(D^{*}) = 0.270 \\pm 0.035 \\pm 0.028$ and $P_{\\tau}(D^{*}) = -0.38 \\pm 0.51 \\pm 0.21$, where the first uncertainty is statistical and the second is systematic.",
